Rāma pleads married life and sends her to Lakṣmaṇa --- Lakṣmaṇa claims slavery and sends her back as junior wife --- Tricked Śūrpaṇakhā demands Rāma abandon old wife --- Śūrpaṇakhā rushes to eat Sītā before Rāma --- Rāma stops her and orders disfigurement --- Lakṣmaṇa cuts her ears and nose with sword --- Bleeding Śūrpaṇakhā roars and flees to Khara --- Śūrpaṇakhā falls before Khara reporting Rāma party